      265.89,
      472.09,
      321.69,
      483.16
    ],
    "text": "Regulations",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      496.09,
      539.91,
      519.16
    ],
    "text": "1. These regulations may be cited as the Food (Colour Coding for Sugar levels) Regulations 2016 and shallcome into force from 01st August 2016.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      532.09,
      539.89,
      555.16
    ],
    "text": "2. No person shall sell, offer for sale, distribute or advertise any food specified in the Schedule I hereto unlesssuch food is labelled in the manner as specified in regulation 3.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      83.85,
      568.09,
      539.91,
      579.16
    ],
    "text": "3. The container or the package which contains such food shall have a label which shall adhere to the following -",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      83.85,
      592.09,
      469.07,
      603.16
    ],
    "text": "(a) a numerical description of the sugar content as specified in Column 1 of the Schedule II ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      83.85,
      616.09,
      447.52,
      627.16
    ],
    "text": "(b) a description of the relative sugar level as specified in Column 2 of the Schedule II ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      84.45,
      640.09,
      518.91,
      651.16
    ],
    "text": "(c) a colour code displayed as specified in Column 3 of the Schedule II and as illustrated in Schedule III ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      664.09,
      539.94,
      687.16
    ],
    "text": "(d) the diameter of the inner circle in the logo shown under Schedule III which specifies the colour relating toparticular sugar level, shall not be less than 1 cm ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
